      "emotion_valence": 0.3,
      "emotion_arousal": 0.55,
      "emotion_category": "self-doubt"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 17,
      "lyric_text": "It must be exhausting, always rooting for the anti-hero",
      "summary": "副歌点题：「一直为反英雄加油，一定很累吧」——替爱自己的人说出疲惫，是更深一层的自责。",
      "metaphor_analysis": null,
      "allusions": [],
      "wordplay": "anti-hero（反英雄）：文学中有缺陷的主角。Taylor 把自己从「美国甜心」重新定位为「反英雄」。",
      "emotional_tone": "self-doubt",
      "cultural_context": null,
      "taylor_swift_context": null,
      "related_lines": [],
      "emotion_valence": 0.3,
      "emotion_arousal": 0.5,
      "emotion_category": "self-doubt"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 18,
      "lyric_text": "Sometimes I feel like everybody is a sexy baby",
      "summary": "最受争议的一句：「人人都是性感宝贝，而我是山丘上的怪物」——身材焦虑与年龄焦虑的超现实表达。",
      "metaphor_analysis": "sexy baby 指婴儿化的女性审美标准；monster on the hill 是被排除在标准外的自我——巨大、笨拙、被围观。",
